   "sample":"5 consecutive 00Z cycles 2026-07-20..2026-07-24 x 4 cities, 31 members",
   "units":"degF",
   "why":"max and mean do not commute; the live path maximises each member then averages, the backfill averages then maximises"
  },
  "product":"gefs pgrb2sp25 geavg + gespr, TMAX 2 m above ground",
  "resolution":"0p25",
  "spread_caveat":"spread_f is the ensemble spread of the TMAX field in one interval, not the spread of the members' daily maxima, and it is measured to have essentially no correlation with the realised day's error. Use the calibrated per-bucket sigma_f, not this per-day spread, as a predictive sigma.",
  "spread_rule":"gespr TMAX at the interval where geavg attains its daily maximum",
  "why_not":"max and mean do not commute; the live path maximises each member then averages, the backfill averages then maximises"
 },
